[Step 1] Delta_n(x) (cancelled) = (-n*x**4 - n*x**2 + 2*n*x + x**2 - 3*x)/(n**2 - n)
  numerator N(n,x) = -n*x**4 - n*x**2 + 2*n*x + x**2 - 3*x
  denominator D(n) = n*(n - 1)

  Cross-check against K2_full_cdf_attempt/ATTEMPT.md Sec 5.5 cited form:
    cited Delta = (-n*x**4 - n*x**2 + 2*n*x + x**2 - 3*x)/(n*(n - 1))
    (own_derivation - cited) simplifies to: 0  (expect 0)

[Step 2] N(n,x) as polynomial in n has degree 1
  N(n,x) = n*g1(x) + g0(x)
  g1(x) = -x**4 - x**2 + 2*x
  g0(x) = x**2 - 3*x

  => Delta_n(x) = g1(x)/(n-1) + g0(x)/[n(n-1)]

  n*Delta_n(x) - g1(x) = p(x)/(n-1),  p(x) = g1(x)+g0(x) = -x**4 - x
  => Delta_n(x) = g1(x)/n + p(x)/[n(n-1)]

